Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:38.01,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“Find the line between
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:38.01,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}what's free and what people
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:38.01,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,262)\fad(200,0)}will pay for”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think with open
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:02.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,source, the most
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.60,0:00:03.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,important thing is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.78,0:00:04.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,figuring out that line
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.74,0:00:06.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,of value of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.02,0:00:06.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,you know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.30,0:00:06.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,people are going to use
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:07.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,it for free and that's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.86,0:00:09.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,part of the point
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.10,0:00:12.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,but then where do you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.02,0:00:13.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,know they're serious and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.52,0:00:14.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,where do you know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.02,0:00:14.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,they're willing to pay
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:16.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,for it? So I think
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.36,0:00:18.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,you've both got great
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.08,0:00:19.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,approaches with theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.10,0:00:20.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's open source
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:21.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,but yet it's all about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:23.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,the service aspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:24.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,and you really want to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:25.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can run it yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.66,0:00:27.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,do you really want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.32,0:00:28.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's a lot of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.42,0:00:30.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,So the hardest part is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.72,0:00:32.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,the thing that you're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.16,0:00:32.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,doing and that people
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.86,0:00:33.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,are paying for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.62,0:00:34.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,And I think it's finding
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:36.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,whatever that line is in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.74,0:00:38.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,the niche where you are
